CONFIDENCE: 97

The solution is unique. Ann must sit right after Cara and before Dev, and Elif must come before Cara, so Elif < Cara < Ann < Dev. Checking the placements of Ann gives three cases. Ann in slot 4 forces Finn into slot 7, which breaks the Finn–Dev gap. Ann in slot 6 leaves Ben with no legal slot. Ann in slot 5 gives the only valid arrangement above.
